        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--This is a small-scale card game with linear, fixed stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Estimated playtime: around 1–3 hours, featuring 4 main chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/e444994db58fbd5f57f0789f894a5aa5.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a land far, far away.<br>Once a mighty kingdom, it has fallen into decline due to political strife. Hidden monsters are stirring, and the people are suffering in despair.<br>Until the arrival of three priests — chosen to carry out the will of the Goddess and save the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ca665913218a3b6484062d2a55a3752d.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1383 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the priests and challenge various stages scattered across the kingdom. Clearing stages will grant you new believers and unlock new contracts (cards), allowing you to build an even stronger deck as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.poster.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.webm?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.mp4?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.poster.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.webm?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.mp4?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release Contract</strong>: Spend Action Points to activate contracts, dealing damage or unleashing other powerful effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.poster.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.webm?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.mp4?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Contract</strong>: Discard a contract to gain Action Points, securing resources while searching for better cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.poster.avif?t=1761617670\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.webm?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978700/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.mp4?t=1761617670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering when to release or devour contracts will be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes</strong>: Three priests with completely different attributes, unique contracts, and special abilities. You can freely choose any one—and it’s even possible to clear the game with just a single priest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Mechanic</strong>: Discard cards to gain resources, speeding up deck cycling and strategy execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Consideration</strong>: Enemies don’t just wait for your turn to end—many will react to every action you make. Careful sequencing of your actions is critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Options</strong>: Fast… or even faster!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
